              "fill": "#6A6A70",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Locked against the mark, which now uses Slate + Clay. One rule governs everything: colour means plan state and nothing else. Slate = planned, Clay = actual, Signal = closed. Chrome — kickers, section numbers, primary buttons — is Ink on Paper or Paper on Ink, never coloured. Warning and danger are derived, not brand: #8A6A2B and #9B3B2F.",
