                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The plan can also leave — build here, export anywhere",
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 15,
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ozRXT",
                      "name": "D",
                      "fill": "$ink-60",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "A partner who arrives with nothing can author the plan in Route 2 and export it as .xlsx or PDF — the accepted version, with both acceptances on it. That matters commercially: the tool stops being somewhere their data is trapped and starts being where their plan was made. It also gives the traditional master builder, who has never written a plan down, something to hand a client that looks professional without them having learned a planning tool.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 12.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
